@deepseek-ai/dsh-runtime-xray README · Privacy and permissions：The plugin reads only public runtime information from the active DSH process. It has no external network destination and requires no API key, environment variable, or writable data directory of its own.

Default snapshots and diagnostic files exclude:

- credentials and environment values;
- prompt and runtime-context content;
- variable values, approval payloads, and tool results;
- callable objects and arbitrary plugin configuration;
- raw session and runtime entity identities.
